>> list := Akojọ tuntun.
list ~ ['hello'].
Ijade kọ: list iye-nọmba.
list fi-kun-opin: ['world'].
Ijade kọ: list iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: list gba-igbehin, kọ: list iye-nọmba.
list fi-kun-opin: ['there'].
Ijade kọ: list iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: (list ipo: 0), kọ: (list ipo: 1).
list fi: ['xmas'] si: 1.
list fi: ['merry'] si: 0.
Ijade kọ: list iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: (list ipo: 0), kọ: (list ipo: 1).
